repository-code: "https://github.com/wtrevena/feasibility-of-creating-majorana-modes-in-silicon-nanowires"
url: "https://github.com/wtrevena/feasibility-of-creating-majorana-modes-in-silicon-nanowires"
version: "draft-v2"
date-released: "2026-06-10"
abstract: >
  Bogoliubov-de Gennes, Luttinger-Kohn, and recursive-Green's-function code
  for a quantitative feasibility study of Majorana zero modes in silicon
  nanowires (conduction-band failure mechanisms including interface-step
  valley pi-junctions; conditional hole-platform designs with Si:B and Al
  parents). All manuscript figures and numbers regenerate from this repository.
keywords: [Majorana, silicon, valleytronics, superconductivity, BdG, Luttinger-Kohn]
license: MIT
